From 7b7aec0bd05821af765a5b60a75bb9aac1155416 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lakshay <b.lakshay@iitg.ac.in>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:17:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] HBF: clock-independent ns timers, configurable idle-drain
 quiet period, array-busy stat

-gpgpu_hbf_<timer>_ns overrides each tick-valued HBF timer and is converted
with the run's DRAM clock (Ramulator's tCK when Ramulator is on), so tR no
longer changes when the DRAM model changes. get_dram_freq() returns double.
The per-channel utilisation stat now divides by elapsed DRAM ticks.
---
